# 统一行尾：仓库一律存 LF，工作区也落 LF。
# 之前有编辑器把十几个 .rs 改成 CRLF，`git status` 出现整文件 diff，
# 必须靠 `git diff --ignore-cr-at-eol` 才看得出真实改动。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制：不做行尾转换
*.gguf binary
*.onnx binary
*.safetensors binary
*.bin binary
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.so binary
*.dylib binary
*.zip binary

# cmd.exe 对纯 LF 的批处理容错差
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
